@204. Men have abused freedom to will and do evil, and rationality to think and confirm it.

@286. It follows that man could abuse these faculties...

@AR 566[5]. The truths you have abused to confirm...

@TCR 490[end]. Man dooms himself to Hell by the abuse of freewill in spiritual things...

