@5135[6]. "Accursed things" = falsities and evils.

@5432[end]. With devout prayer to the Lord.

@5897[10]. The nations that were thus accursed.

@6306. Therefore they were given to the curse.

@8478[2]. Such curse themselves.

@8593[3]. "All things there (with Amalek) given to the curse" = that evil Genii should have no communication whatever with those of the Spiritual Church...

@9192[5]. These are they who will be accursed, that is, cast out. @9193.

